---
description: >-
  Issue #673: `layout: layered` ignores the edge sides for placement, so architecture keeps
  `compass` (D556) and warns ARCHITECTURE_LAYOUT_IGNORED. The junctions form a clean cross:
  Left and Right either side of j1, Bottom under j2, as with no layout set.
config:
  layout: layered
---
architecture-beta
    service top(server)[Top]
    junction j1
    junction j2
    service l(server)[Left]
    service r(server)[Right]
    service bot(server)[Bottom]
    top:B -- T:j1
    j1:L -- R:l
    j1:R -- L:r
    j1:B -- T:j2
    j2:B -- T:bot
